  "markdown": "# Peta Learning Outcomes dan Cara Belajar\n\n> [!info] Sumber: syllabus resmi Binusmaya (LMS), dibaca 20 Oktober 2026\n> ENPR6106005, kelas LD28, 2 SKS. Buku: Crawford dan Di Benedetto (2025) *New Products Management* (McGraw Hill); Alston dan DeKerchove (2024) *Inclusion by Design*. Dosen materi: Gromyko Bongso.\n\n## Penilaian\n| Komponen | Bobot |\n|---|---|\n| Mid exam teori | 30%, jadwal 9 November 2026 |\n| Project | 50% (AI flexible) |\n| Assignment | 20% |\n\n## 3 Learning Outcome\n| LO | Level | Isi | Indikator rubrik |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| LO1 | C1 Knowledge | Identify key concepts and processes in new product management and market-driven innovation | 1.1 konsep kunci NPD (lebih dari 85% relevan benar); 1.2 proses inovasi berbasis pasar |\n| LO2 | C3 Application | Apply appropriate tools and frameworks to evaluate and develop new products aligned with strategy and customer needs | 2.1 alat analisis evaluasi produk baru; 2.2 kerangka manajerial untuk keputusan pengembangan produk |\n| LO3 | C5 Synthesis | Create an integrated new product development and launch plan combining product design and marketing strategy | 3.1 rencana NPD (konsep, desain, pengujian, kesesuaian pasar); 3.2 rencana peluncuran dan branding (positioning, taktik, jadwal, metrik, regulasi dan etika) |\n\n## Peta sesi\n| Sesi | Judul | LO |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | The Strategic Elements of Product Development and the New Product Process | LO1 |\n| 2 | Opportunity Identification and Selection: Planning for New Products | LO1 |\n| 3 | The Product Concept and Ready-Made New Product Ideas | LO1, LO2 |\n| 4 | New Product Ideas: The Problem Find-Solve Approach | LO2 |\n| 5 | New Product Ideas: Analytical Attribute Approaches | LO2 |\n| 6 | Concept Evaluation and Testing | LO2 |\n| 7 | The Full Screen and Sales Forecasting | LO2 |\n| 8 | Product Protocol | LO2 |\n| 9 | Design | LO3 |\n| 10 | Development Team Management and Product Use Testing | LO3 |\n| 11 | Strategic Launch Planning and Implementation of the Strategic Plan | LO3 |\n| 12 | Market Testing and Launch Management | LO3 |\n| 13 | Public Policy Issues | LO3 |\n\n## Cara belajar\nMid exam (9 Nov) kemungkinan mencakup sesi awal. Ringkasan sesi mengikuti urutan slide dosen dengan gambar tepat di bawah penjelasannya. Fokus pada kerangka dan proses (new product process, protocol, screening, forecasting) karena rubrik LO2 menilai ketepatan memilih dan menerapkan kerangka. Tanyakan dosen cakupan pastinya."
